# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=gdk-pixbuf
pkgver=2.42.12
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="Image loading for GTK programs (PNG, JPEG)"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gdk-pixbuf"
license=(LGPL-2.1-or-later)
depends=(glibc glib libpng libjpeg-turbo shared-mime-info)
install=gdk-pixbuf.install
source=("https://download.gnome.org/sources/gdk-pixbuf/2.42/gdk-pixbuf-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('b9505b3445b9a7e48ced34760c3bcb73e966df3ac94c95a148cb669ab748e3c7')

build() {
    meson setup gdk-pixbuf-$pkgver build --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release \
        -D introspection=disabled -D man=false -D tests=false -D installed_tests=false \
        -D tiff=disabled -D gtk_doc=false -D others=disabled
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
